{"channelId":"UCY2aK1HwX9b0k07hBaO8teA","row":["Noble Veterinary Clinics",209,"We’re reimagining how people think about veterinary care\n\nSince 2006, our goal has been to provide the highest standards of routine and emergency veterinary care. We strive to create an experience where families feel heard and pets feel safe. This vision continues to guide us today.\n\nOur founders have designed each clinic for comfort, privacy, and a welcoming, stress-free experience at every visit. Our conveniently located branches ensure expert care is always close by.\n\nTransparency matters to us; we openly discuss all treatment options and costs upfront, ensuring clarity and peace of mind. As fellow pet parents, we care for your pets as we would our own.","","United Arab Emirates"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY2aK1HwX9b0k07hBaO8teA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY2aK1HwX9b0k07hBaO8teA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:15.562Z","channelId":"UCY2aK1HwX9b0k07hBaO8teA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"928c993af3a1ca42a94336e2c9f6156d5083362e8735d2e724f6c0bfb2e99d53","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"fee9236069e487d8826940e39ab0af3b0a32102802cc0cdb2dc0c505603d8055"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY2aK1HwX9b0k07hBaO8teA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:15.562Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY2aK1HwX9b0k07hBaO8teA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":209,"raw":"209 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY2aK1HwX9b0k07hBaO8teA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:15.562Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["veterinary"],"relevantKeywords":["veterinary"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY2aK1HwX9b0k07hBaO8teA"]}],"cleanup":{"